{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18214","headline":"和席八十二韵 · 韩愈","name":"和席八十二韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"绦阙银河曙，东风右掖春。\n官随名共美，花与思俱新。\n绮陌朝游间，绫衾夜直频。\n横门开日月，高阁切星辰。\n庭变寒前草，天销霁後尘。\n沟声通苑急，柳色压城匀。\n纶綍谋猷盛，丹青步武亲。\n芳菲含斧藻，光景畅形神。\n傍砌看红药，巡池咏白苹。\n多情怀酒伴，余事作诗人。\n倚玉难藏拙，吹竽久混真。\n坐慙空自老，江海未还身。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18214.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18214","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}